Ranking based on noise canceling technologies, battery life, and brand reputation for noise-canceling headphones. The Bose QuietComfort Ultra Headphones, Sony WH-1000XM5, The Razer Opus, Px7 S2 headphones, Beats Studio Pro, and Audio-Technica’s ATH-ANC900BT are the top rated noise-canceling headphones and are recommended for immersive entertainment and clear calls.

The lower-ranked products are Yamaha HPH-MT8 studio monitor headphones and Galaxy Buds Pro, as they offer good noise cancelation but are designed primarily for studio and live usage, and for true wireless earbuds respectively.
